{"_meta":{"about":"Famous places that get a large, characteristic icon. Coordinates read from the English Wikipedia coordinates API (2026-09-04), never typed by hand. Selection favours the spots foreign visitors actually go to.","note":"These carry no written story - tapping one opens its English Wikipedia article. The ten places in places-world.json are the ones with stories.","tier":"tier は表示を始めるズーム（TIER_ZOOM）のゲート専用。2026-09-05 時点の英語版分位のまま凍結してある。pop と一緒に付け替えると、大きさを変えただけのつもりでz4-z5 に出る名所が入れ替わってしまう。大きさは pop、出す出さないは tier。","pop":"pop は大きさだけを決める。英語版と日本語版の直近12か月の閲覧数の合計で機械的に切る。1>=630,957 / 2>=199,526 / 3>=63,096 / 4=それ未満。分位ではなく絶対値なので、名所を足しても他の大きさは変わらない。日本語版を足すのは、英語版だけだと外国人観光客の知名度で日本の名所を並べることになるため（松本城 en 72,383 / ja 176,337）。","pop_fixed":"places-world.json の19か所は pop=1、liminal.json の26か所はexplore.js の POP_LIM=3 で固定。閲覧数では測らない。wiki 欄が別主題を指すものがあり、実測すると『命を救った石』は 2011 Tōhoku earthquake and tsunami の 1,677,674 で富士山（1,135,329）を超えて日本一大きいピンになる。数字は正しいが、指しているものが違う。","wiki_fields":"wiki_en / wiki_ja は tools/verify_wiki.py が API で検証して書いたもの。手で書いた英題は実在しないことがある（26件中7件が実際そうだった）。wiki は互換のため残してあるが、アプリは wiki_en / wiki_ja を見る。"},"landmarks":[{"emoji":"🐳","name":"Osaka Aquarium Kaiyukan","ja":"海遊館","lat":34.654472,"lon":135.428889,"wiki":"Osaka Aquarium Kaiyukan","kind":"aquarium","tier":3,"views":89396,"views_en":41658,"views_ja":47738,"wiki_ja":"海遊館","pop":3,"wiki_en":"Osaka Aquarium Kaiyukan"},{"emoji":"🎨","name":"Naoshima","ja":"直島","lat":34.458333,"lon":133.983333,"wiki":"Naoshima","kind":"art","tier":3,"views":52118,"views_en":12190,"views_ja":39928,"wiki_ja":"直島町","pop":4,"wiki_en":"Naoshima"},{"emoji":"🏯","name":"Himeji Castle","ja":"姫路城","lat":34.839444,"lon":134.693889,"wiki":"Himeji Castle","kind":"castle","tier":1,"views":570770,"views_en":288359,"views_ja":282411,"wiki_ja":"姫路城","pop":2,"wiki_en":"Himeji Castle"},{"emoji":"🏯","name":"Kumamoto Castle","ja":"熊本城","lat":32.806063,"lon":130.705972,"wiki":"Kumamoto Castle","kind":"castle","tier":2,"views":205431,"views_en":61180,"views_